    {
      "kind": "request",
      "text": "Help me plan my study time for the Applied Data Ethics case memo over the next two weeks. Which deadline should we plan around? I have a module outline and a learning platform export. Check my calendar and ask what times work for me before making a proposal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "question",
      "id": "study-windows",
      "text": "For Nov 2–15, what recurring study windows suit you? Your calendar has weekday work 08:00–12:00 and lunch 12:00–13:00; classes/commutes on Mon, Wed, Thu evenings (17:30 onward), plus Thursday exercise 16:30–17:30. Sunday Nov 8 has personal time 10:00–13:00. Tell me weekdays and start/end times (São Paulo time); you can include mornings on non-work days, weekday afternoons, or other times.",
      "choices": [
        "Weekday afternoons, 13:00–17:00",
        "Saturday and Sunday afternoons",
        "Different times"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "question",
      "id": "weekly-target",
      "text": "How many study hours per week should I allocate to this memo during the two-week period?",
      "choices": [
        "2 hours/week",
        "3 hours/week",
        "4 hours/week",
        "Other"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "question",
      "id": "daily-cap-breaks",
      "text": "What is your maximum study time per day, and how many minutes of break should separate hourly study blocks?",
      "choices": [
        "1 hour/day; no break needed",
        "1 hour/day; 10-minute break",
        "2 hours/day; 10-minute break",
        "Other"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "questionId": "study-windows",
      "text": "For these two weeks, Wednesday, Thursday and Friday from 14:00 to 16:15 can work when the calendar is clear. I prefer to keep the weekend open."
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "questionId": "weekly-target",
      "text": "Four study hours a week feels workable, with no more than two sessions a day and a 15-minute break between them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "questionId": "daily-cap-breaks",
      "text": "I picked a case but haven't written an outline. I don't know how much time it will take yet."
    },
